  <XDFTABLE uniqueid="0x5BE9" flags="0x0">
    <title>Ignition Timing Trim Cold</title>
    <description>Exact JK08A. Address 0x991A; 16 rows x 16 columns; uint8; map confidence code. Cold Ignition Timing Map: additive correction of calculated MBT in cold mode; the low 7 bits carry a signed-offset quantity, while bit 7 carries a knock-window flag. This view edits mask 0x7F and preserves the other bits in each cell. The table is homologous to EV18A 0x9976 with a constant layout offset of +0x5c across the entire trio. The physical scale and mode name are confirmed by the A2L catalog; code confirms table selection, the 0x7f mask, and participation of the result in angle calculation.</description>
    <CATEGORYMEM index="0" category="8" />
