  <XDFTABLE uniqueid="0x24E1" flags="0x0">
    <title>Ignition Timing Trim Main</title>
    <description>Exact JK08A. Address 0x9A1A; 16 rows x 16 columns; uint8; map confidence code. High Octane Ignition Timing Map: additive correction of calculated MBT in high-octane mode; the low 7 bits carry a signed-offset quantity, while bit 7 carries a knock-window flag. This view edits mask 0x7F and preserves the other bits in each cell. Code selects the table relative to the high-detonation branch and preserves bit 7 separately. The physical name and scale match homolog EV18A 0x9a76 with the shared layout offset of +0x5c.</description>
